cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OnSIR, please cite it as below."
title: "OnSIR: Ontology for Seed Irradiation and Plant Radiobiology"
abstract: >-
  An OWL 2 DL ontology of seed-irradiation treatments and their dose-dependent
  biological effects, aligned to BFO, PO, NCBITaxon, ChEBI, PATO, ENVO, PECO and TO, units in
  QUDT, with dose-to-effect axioms and taxon dose windows for description-logic reasoning.
type: dataset
version: "1.6.0"
date-released: "2026-10-02"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://w3id.org/onsir"
repository-code: "https://github.com/lfmalves/OnSIR"
keywords:
  - ontology
  - seed irradiation
  - plant radiobiology
  - radiohormesis
  - mutation breeding
  - OWL
  - description logic
